    "Reversed rays, projected to their terminal vertex", "TableText",
     ExpressionUUID->"3067da0f-95b6-4862-a692-b9cbb672465a"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "28ecb364-2506-46f0-83d1-5940a520ab92"], Cell[
    "InfraDisplacementBundle[g,r]", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "18cea9ef-c5f1-4311-95c5-00d44e7e8f52"], Cell["\<\
Pairs of vertices at distance r, projected to the first vertex\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"bee8c6d0-53f6-46ea-baaf-814fdded644f"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "f285c977-d9d0-4820-8aa6-c272e8ce4979"], Cell[
